@@@!atrep-hom
@=at-html=>at-markdown

@@/ The lossy direction of the std pair: markdown has no list
@@/ containers, span, or division, so they dissolve into their
@@/ content; em and strong rename to the markdown markers. The
@@/ reverse embedding (at-markdown => at-html) needs no file:
@@/ it is derived from at-markdown's lineage.

@:: / *
@:: ! **
@<< --
@<< ..
@<< ,
@<< _
@-- ~

@@/ The target has no table family: a table drops with its rows,
@@/ cells and spans (recorded loss).
@-- +
@-- +-
@-- +=
@-- +:
@-- +>
@-- +_
